OL,3,ANandy 'minded to intervene' in Sky's
OL,4,A#1.6bn takeover of ITV entertainment
OL,5,Aarm
OL,6,
OL,7,FLisa Nandy has said she is "minded to
OL,8,Fintervene" in the proposed #1.6bn deal
OL,9,Ffor Sky to buy ITV's media and
OL,10,Fentertainment division.
OL,12,FThe culture secretary said there were
OL,13,Freasonable grounds to believe the deal
OL,14,Fcould affect free expression in the
OL,15,Fmedia and the variety of Britain's news
OL,16,Flandscape.
OL,18,FSky said it would "carefully consider"
OL,19,Fa letter from Nandy and "engage
OL,20,Fconstructively" with the review into
OL,21,Fthe deal.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
