OL,3,ANandy 'minded to intervene' in Sky's
OL,4,A#1.6bn takeover of ITV entertainment
OL,5,Aarm
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We remain confident that bringing Sky
OL,8,Fand ITV's media and entertainment
OL,9,Fbusiness together will create a
OL,10,Fstronger British media," it said.
